        {"zh": "寻找我的伴侣，很重要。", "en": "Finding my mate is important."},
        {"zh": "我们在岩浆边走，灯并着灯。", "en": "We walk the lava's edge, lantern beside lantern."},
        {"zh": "和我在一起，很安全。", "en": "Stay with me, it’s safe."},
        {"zh": "我的灯笼，在岩浆上也不灭。", "en": "My lantern doesn't go out, even on lava."},
